	column Peso_Obj1 = ```
			
			    CALCULATE(
			        VALUES(RH_PesosVariable[Obj1]),
			        FILTER(
			            RH_PesosVariable,
			            RH_PesosVariable[Cargo] = RH_VariableMensual[Cargo] &&
			             RH_PesosVariable[Gestion ] = YEAR(RH_VariableMensual[Periodo]) &&
			             RH_PesosVariable[Mes] = MONTH(RH_VariableMensual[Periodo])
			        )
			    )
			```
		formatString: 0\ %;-0\ %;0\ %
		lineageTag: 4f756fcf-df4f-4ed3-b83f-00a12528befa
